# Module structure (Importou)

Each feature module under `src/modules/{name}/`:

```
{name}/
├── api/
│   ├── public/          # importer/exporter/broker HTTP
│   ├── backoffice/      # admin HTTP
│   └── common/          # shared guards/decorators when needed
├── application/
│   ├── public|backoffice|internal/
│   │   ├── commands/
│   │   ├── queries/
│   │   └── handlers/
├── domain/
│   ├── entities/
│   ├── events/
│   └── {name}.repository.ts   # interface
├── infra/
│   ├── {name}.repository.ts   # Prisma impl
│   ├── {name}.mapper.ts
│   └── {name}.data-access-object.ts
└── {name}.module.ts
```

## Naming

- Files kebab-case; classes PascalCase.
- Commands: `{module}-{context}-{action}.command.ts`
- Imports only `@src/...`.

## Example domains

`auth`, `organization`, `membership`, `user`, `import-operation`, `exporter-quote`, `broker-proposal`, `audit`.

Do not scaffold Offer/Investment/Token modules.

$END$
